    "ruleType": "unit-ability",
    "group": "Roboute Guilliman",
    "summary": "As [your Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase) begins, pick 2 of the abilities below. This model has them until your next Command phase.\n\n- **Primarch of the XIII (Aura)**: models in your **ADEPTUS ASTARTES** units up to 6\" from this model get +1 OC, and you can also re-roll those units' [Leadership](vsdata:core-rule/leadership-rolls) and [Battle-shock tests](vsdata:core-rule/battle-shock).\n- **Master of Battle**: as your Command phase begins, after picking the target of your Oath of Moment, you also pick a second enemy unit. If that first target is **destroyed** before your next Command phase, the second unit replaces it as the target of your Oath of Moment until you next pick one.\n- **Supreme Strategist**: for your whole army, once per battle round, whenever you target an **ADEPTUS ASTARTES** unit of yours up to 12\" from a model with this ability with a [Stratagem](vsdata:core-rule/stratagems), you can make that use cost 1CP less.",
